{
  "info": {
    "name": "Ecofintech API",
    "description": "Requests da API da Ecofintech.\n\n**Fluxo:** Auth → Cadastrar → Login (salva o token) → demais requests. Rodando a collection inteira (*Run collection*), tudo acontece nessa ordem e o usuário de teste é removido no fim.\n\nA autenticação (Bearer `{{token}}`) é configurada na collection e herdada por todas as requests; as públicas usam *No Auth*.\n\nVariáveis:\n- `base_url`: endereço da API\n- `user_email` / `user_password`: credenciais do usuário cadastrado\n- `user_new_password`: usada em Alterar senha (as duas trocam de lugar após a troca)\n- `user_id`, `token`: preenchidas automaticamente",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "auth": {
    "type": "bearer",
    "bearer": [{ "key": "token", "value": "{{token}}", "type": "string" }]
  },
  "variable": [
    { "key": "base_url", "value": "http://localhost:3000", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "user_email", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "user_password", "value": "senhaForte123", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "user_new_password", "value": "novaSenha456", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "user_id", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "token", "value": "", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "account_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" },
    { "key": "transaction_id", "value": "1", "type": "string" }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "Health",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Verificar API",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/",
            "description": "Verifica se a API está no ar. Pública."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Auth",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Cadastrar",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/users",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Maria Silva\",\n  \"email\": \"maria.{{$timestamp}}@email.com\",\n  \"date_of_birth\": \"1995-08-20\",\n  \"password\": \"{{user_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Cadastra um usuário (POST /users). Pública.\n\nSalva `user_id` e `user_email` para o Login. O e-mail usa `{{$timestamp}}` para ser único a cada execução.\n\nErros: 400 (dados inválidos), 409 (e-mail já cadastrado)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 201', () => pm.response.to.have.status(201));",
                  "",
                  "const user = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Não devolve a senha', () => {",
                  "  pm.expect(user).to.not.have.property('password');",
                  "  pm.expect(user).to.not.have.property('password_hash');",
                  "});",
                  "",
                  "if (user.id) {",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('user_id', user.id);",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('user_email', user.email);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "request": {
            "auth": { "type": "noauth" },
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/login",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"email\": \"{{user_email}}\",\n  \"password\": \"{{user_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Faz login e devolve o token. Pública.\n\nSalva o token na variável `token`, usada automaticamente pelas outras requests.\n\nErros: 401 (e-mail ou senha inválidos)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "",
                  "const body = pm.response.json();",
                  "pm.test('Devolve o token', () => pm.expect(body.access_token).to.be.a('string'));",
                  "",
                  "if (body.access_token) pm.collectionVariables.set('token', body.access_token);"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Usuário logado (me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/auth/me",
            "description": "Devolve os dados do usuário dono do token.\n\nErros: 401 (token ausente, inválido ou expirado)."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));",
                  "pm.test('É o usuário logado', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json().id).to.eql(pm.collectionVariables.get('user_id')));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Users",
      "description": "Exigem token. Nas rotas com `:id`, o id precisa ser o do usuário logado (senão 403).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Listar usuários",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/users",
            "description": "Lista todos os usuários, do mais recente para o mais antigo. **Somente admin.**\n\nO usuário criado em Cadastrar é comum, então aqui recebe 403. Com o token de um admin, retorna 200.\n\nPara promover alguém (no pgAdmin): `UPDATE users SET role = 'admin' WHERE email = '...';`"
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('200 para admin, 403 para usuário comum', () => pm.expect(pm.response.code).to.be.oneOf([200, 403]));",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "  pm.test('Retorna uma lista', () => pm.expect(pm.response.json()).to.be.an('array'));",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar usuário",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}",
            "description": "Busca o usuário pelo id.\n\nErros: 400 (id não é UUID), 401, 403 (não é o próprio usuário), 404."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Atualizar usuário",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"name\": \"Maria S. Souza\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Atualiza só os campos enviados (`name`, `email`, `date_of_birth`). A senha não é aceita aqui: use **Alterar senha**.\n\nErros: 400, 401, 403, 404, 409."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 200', () => pm.response.to.have.status(200));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Alterar senha",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}/password",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n  \"current_password\": \"{{user_password}}\",\n  \"new_password\": \"{{user_new_password}}\"\n}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            },
            "description": "Altera a senha. Exige a senha atual.\n\nApós a troca, `user_password` e `user_new_password` trocam de lugar, então o Login continua funcionando e esta request pode rodar de novo.\n\nErros: 400 (senha atual incorreta ou nova senha inválida), 401, 403, 404."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));",
                  "",
                  "if (pm.response.code === 204) {",
                  "  const current = pm.collectionVariables.get('user_password');",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('user_password', pm.collectionVariables.get('user_new_password'));",
                  "  pm.collectionVariables.set('user_new_password', current);",
                  "}"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "name": "Remover usuário",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/users/{{user_id}}",
            "description": "Remove o próprio usuário.\n\nErros: 400, 401, 403, 404."
          },
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "type": "text/javascript",
                "exec": [
                  "pm.test('Status 204', () => pm.response.to.have.status(204));"
                ]
              }
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Accounts",
      "description": "Exigem token. Rotas ainda são o esqueleto gerado pela CLI (sem banco).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Criar conta",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/accounts",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar contas",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/accounts" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar conta",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/accounts/{{account_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Atualizar conta",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/accounts/{{account_id}}",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remover conta",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/accounts/{{account_id}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "Transactions",
      "description": "Exigem token. Rotas ainda são o esqueleto gerado pela CLI (sem banco).",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Criar transação",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/transactions",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Listar transações",
          "request": { "method": "GET", "url": "{{base_url}}/transactions" }
        },
        {
          "name": "Buscar transação",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/transactions/{{transaction_id}}"
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Atualizar transação",
          "request": {
            "method": "PATCH",
            "header": [{ "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }],
            "url": "{{base_url}}/transactions/{{transaction_id}}",
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{}",
              "options": { "raw": { "language": "json" } }
            }
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "Remover transação",
          "request": {
            "method": "DELETE",
            "url": "{{base_url}}/transactions/{{transaction_id}}"
          }
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
